{"id":"n26872-1-10","stage":0,"title":"실례 · 失礼","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26872-1-10-1","ko":"실례지만 혹시 지금 몇 시입니까?","zh":"打扰一下，现在几点了呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"실례지만","meaning":"失礼","explanation":"실례：失礼；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"실례","audio":"/audio/a093e7a78337b547c773.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26872","senseId":"1","lemma":"실례","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"혹시","meaning":"是不是，是否","explanation":"혹시：是不是，是否","readings":[{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87955","senseId":"4","lemma":"혹시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시입니까?","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a093e7a78337b547","term":"실례","zh":"失礼","audio":"/audio/a093e7a78337b547c773.mp3","entryId":"26872","definition":"言行违背礼仪；或指那样的言行。","pronunciation":["실례"]},{"id":"c99406fc3132c80d","term":"혹시","zh":"是不是，是否","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3","entryId":"87955","definition":"用于对不确定的事情提出疑问，表示虽认为如此，但因不确定而犹豫要不要说。","pronunciation":["혹씨"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3